WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 90s v1.0 — ai-reads-human (zu) · microsoft-edge-neural

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:23.714
<v Narrator>Okuqala, amakhompyutha avame ukushintsha idatha ngefomethi yombhalo obhalwe ngamazinyo kamuntu, okuholela kuma-machines ukuba asebenzise umsebenzi ongeziwe. Okulandelayo, ukufunda umbhalo wokuhlela ofakwe ngaphakathi kwathatha isikhathi esingaphezu kukakhulu kabili kune-chip energy kunalokho ukufunda inani lemishini encane.

2
00:00:23.794 --> 00:00:35.370
<v Narrator>Okuthathu, ukuchoboza umbhalo obekwe ngezingxenye zegama le-AI kuqhuma amandla angaphezu kwamaphesenti ayishumi nambili kunalokho okucubungula umbhalo ngokwawo.

3
00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:56.494
<v Narrator>Amafomethi agcwele ama-curly braces, ama-commas, nama-indented spaces afakwe ukuze abantu bangabheka amafayela ngokunethezeka kuma-editors ombhalo. Kodwa-ke, amathuluzi e-AI amanje adlula amazigidi zamarekhodi wokubhala ocacile kusuka kumshini kuya kumshini ngaphandle komuntu obheke njalo.

4
00:00:56.574 --> 00:01:23.083
<v Narrator>Sibiza le misebenzi engaphezulu nge-impedance tax futhi siyihlola izinsuku ezingu-34 zokuhlela nokuhlukanisa amagama asebenza kuwo wonke amarekhodi ayizigidi eziyisithupha. Ukuqhuba ngayinye yalezi zimo ngaphakathi kwenqubo yomsebenzi ohlukanisiwe kwiprosesa ye-Apple ngokucophelela kwahlukanisa izikweletu ezincane zokuhlela kusuka kumisebenzi ye-laptop engasemva.

5
00:01:23.163 --> 00:01:56.518
<v Narrator>Ukukhishwa kwe-23-byte binary record kusetshenziswa ama-nanojoules angamakhulu amabili anamashumi ayisishiyagalombili. Umbhalo ojwayelekile we-bracketed usetshenziswa cishe izikhathi ezisithupha ngaphezulu, umbhalo ofakwe ngaphakathi wenziwe ngezikhathi eziyinkulungwane ezimbili nesikhombisa namashumi amane anesithoba ngaphezulu, futhi umbhalo ofakwe ngaphakathi we-Python ocacile wakhipha amandla echips ayizigidi ezimbili namaphesenti ayisishiyagalolunye.

6
00:01:56.598 --> 00:02:18.590
<v Narrator>Nakuba ukufaka izikhala ezimbili zesizinda esibukekayo ngaphezu kokuphinda kabili i-AI igama-elihlukanisiwe amandla kuya kumashumi ayisishiyagalombili nama-microjoules ngayinye. Gcina amapayipi wemishini yangaphakathi a compact futhi binary, futhi uhlanganise umbhalo kuphela lapho abantu befunda khona.
